      ],
      "text": "Closest rival: two full trolley loads followed by one hand trip. Stage1 finite-model predictions are twelve releases by 13 with seven occupied transfer minutes for this rival, versus nine for hand-only survival. Hand transport displaces two additional minutes onto the transfer clerk while preserving both trolley allowances; inspection still occupies thirteen minutes. These are predictions, not trials or labor superiority."
