      ],
      "text": "B9 has nine brackets despite its ten-bracket packing mark; completed correction and sealing remain required. Its cause is unknown and establishes no further discrepancy. Later request adaptation is unobserved and cannot alter present demand. No empirical distribution or global optimum proof is supplied; synthetic-model predictions establish no depot performance."
    }
